\newlabel{fig:speedup}{{2}{12}{\textbf {Projected} speedup over the \textbf {measured} scalar baseline by ISA and payload size. SIMD throughput values are analytical projections, not measurements. The dashed red line indicates the $5\times $ target. Based on projections, AVX2 and AVX-512 designs exceed $5\times $ for payloads $\geq 1$~KB; the SVE 256-bit design meets the target for payloads $\geq 4$~KB.\relax }{figure.caption.18}{}}
