\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Throughput comparison across production Base64 implementations (values from published benchmarks and documentation; see Section\nobreakspace  {}\ref {sec:related}). Scalar implementations (gray) cluster at 0.3--1.2\nobreakspace  {}GB/s\xspace  . SIMD implementations (colored) range from 2.5 to 10+\nobreakspace  {}GB/s\xspace  , representing a 5--20$\times $ performance gap that remains unexploited in most production software. Error bars indicate reported performance ranges across hardware configurations.\relax }}{15}{figure.caption.23}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:production_gap}{{5}{15}{Throughput comparison across production Base64 implementations (values from published benchmarks and documentation; see Section~\ref {sec:related}). Scalar implementations (gray) cluster at 0.3--1.2~\GBs . SIMD implementations (colored) range from 2.5 to 10+~\GBs , representing a 5--20$\times $ performance gap that remains unexploited in most production software. Error bars indicate reported performance ranges across hardware configurations.\relax }{figure.caption.23}{}}
